# Allow-list build context for deploy/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# Everything is excluded unless re-included below — in particular shared_files/ (SLB confidential corpus),
# .venv/, .git/, .research_cache/, tests/, docs/ and any secrets.
**
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
!src/**
!config/
!config/pm_agent.yaml
!config/dls_catalog.sample.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
